WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:02.331 --> 00:00:05.551
I'm at the Kukkiwon World Taekwondo headquarters

2
00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:06.531
here in Seoul.

3
00:00:06.531 --> 00:00:10.692
Today, I'm going to learn the great art of self defense

4
00:00:10.692 --> 00:00:14.112
and I think given the hour that I have,

5
00:00:14.112 --> 00:00:16.992
I should rise very high, maybe to the highest level.

6
00:00:16.992 --> 00:00:17.853
(audience laughter)

7
00:00:17.853 --> 00:00:20.333 line:15%
They just told me that they wanna give a live demonstration

8
00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:22.913
in my honor, that they've prepared.

9
00:00:22.913 --> 00:00:26.983
This is the plastic chair of honor that I've been given.

10
00:00:26.983 --> 00:00:29.254
We're I think 10 minutes into the production,

11
00:00:29.254 --> 00:00:31.095
and nothing has happened.

12
00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:34.104
I guess this is demonstrating that the best defense

13
00:00:34.104 --> 00:00:37.155
is to not fight at all.

14
00:00:37.155 --> 00:00:42.037
(dramatic, building music)

15
00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.197
I think this is the Korean West Side Story.

16
00:00:53.197 --> 00:00:55.257
(audience applause and laughter)

17
00:00:55.257 --> 00:00:58.757
Okay, this guy is giving the Heimlich maneuver

18
00:00:58.757 --> 00:01:00.837
to that gentleman right there.

19
00:01:00.837 --> 00:01:04.377
Let's see what's happening, whoa!

20
00:01:04.377 --> 00:01:06.557
If you're attacked by two men making love,

21
00:01:06.557 --> 00:01:08.278
you just jump over them.

22
00:01:08.278 --> 00:01:08.779
Whoa!

23
00:01:08.779 --> 00:01:13.509
That's incredible.

24
00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:24.910
Whoa!

25
00:01:34.799 --> 00:01:38.940
(applause)

26
00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:43.830
(dramatic music)

27
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:54.550
(audience laughter)

28
00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:12.780
That's me in one hour.

29
00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:15.419
I would like to learn Taekwondo, and I'd like to show

30
00:02:15.419 --> 00:02:19.320
you my uniform.

31
00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:24.002
(applause)

32
00:02:24.002 --> 00:02:26.924 line:15%
(speaks in foreign language)

33
00:02:26.924 --> 00:02:29.910
Can I make sound effects?

34
00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:34.760
(speaks in foreign language)

35
00:02:37.011 --> 00:02:39.371
Is that okay, is that allowed?

36
00:02:39.371 --> 00:02:41.491
Ha!

37
00:02:41.491 --> 00:02:46.321
(shouting)

38
00:02:52.291 --> 00:02:54.731
Okay, so how many do you want?

39
00:02:54.731 --> 00:02:56.751
We'll start with one.

40
00:02:56.751 --> 00:03:00.453
(shouts)

41
00:03:00.453 --> 00:03:02.933
Answer the question.

42
00:03:02.933 --> 00:03:06.494
How often have you been attacked with plywood?

43
00:03:06.494 --> 00:03:11.223
(audience laughter)

44
00:03:12.413 --> 00:03:14.275
(shouts)

45
00:03:14.275 --> 00:03:18.625
(applause)

46
00:03:20.115 --> 00:03:21.875
Was that helpful?

47
00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:24.995
Broken, smashed, broken.

48
00:03:24.995 --> 00:03:26.335
Two boards?

49
00:03:26.335 --> 00:03:27.155
Can you do more?

50
00:03:27.155 --> 00:03:29.215
Ha!

51
00:03:29.215 --> 00:03:31.995
Two boards, two!

52
00:03:31.995 --> 00:03:33.295
Wait, five?

53
00:03:33.295 --> 00:03:35.235
What are you talking about, five?

54
00:03:35.235 --> 00:03:36.240
What?

55
00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:37.420
No!

56
00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.601
They're making me jump from one to five.

57
00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:44.601
Okay, I'm gonna do it.

58
00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:47.140
(exhales)

59
00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.260
(shouts)

60
00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:52.530
(applause)

61
00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.340
Yeah!

62
00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.440
Ah!

63
00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:08.050
Jesus!

64
00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:12.541
Master Song, there is a person I work with

65
00:04:12.541 --> 00:04:13.940
who irritates me.

66
00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.801 line:15%
(audience laughter)

67
00:04:17.801 --> 00:04:20.161
This has a TDS of, let's say, 400.

68
00:04:20.161 --> 00:04:22.901
This has a TDS, probably, reverse osmosis.

69
00:04:22.901 --> 00:04:23.781
You know what?

70
00:04:23.781 --> 00:04:25.901
I find you TDS.

71
00:04:25.901 --> 00:04:27.541
(audience laughter)

72
00:04:27.541 --> 00:04:31.361
I would like you and your students...

73
00:04:31.361 --> 00:04:34.742
I dont know what, how do you say, "Kick the shit out of..."

74
00:04:34.742 --> 00:04:37.272
To attack?

75
00:04:41.702 --> 00:04:44.829
How about I pretend to attack you with this,

76
00:04:44.829 --> 00:04:49.609
and you defend?

77
00:04:52.229 --> 00:04:54.110
I do nothing important.

78
00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:58.080
I waste your time.

79
00:05:00.251 --> 00:05:02.630
Oh yeah!

80
00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:06.940
(applause)

